This file preserves Block C from the actual Stata session used to obtain the
reported Project 1 inferential results. The workflow was later split into
01_build.do and 02_analyze.do. This is therefore an archived analysis transcript,
not a fresh run of the final split script.

For the publication/repository freeze, replace this file with the clean log
generated by the final 02_analyze.do run.

